    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great news for Bullet Hell fans! We\u2019ve prepared an anthology of games in your favourite genre from various indie developers! Try out free demo versions of projects that have just recently been released or will be out in the near future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickback </strong>is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements, where shooting is the only way to move. Repel waves of mutants, create combinations of weapons and upgrades to survive at all costs on your own or with a friend in a local co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotloop </strong>- Use the force of gravity in a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics and orbital mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Westild's Law</strong> - Journey to the heart of the Wild West in this thrilling pixelated 2D shooter and challenge the gang of Wild Joe to free your hometown from their iron grip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Break</strong> - Breakout game + physics + shooting + building. Use your mouse like in air hockey to kick enemy bombs back into the evil Black Castle! Destroy enemy towers rockets and lasers. Build your base to protect your little dudes - you need them to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=616 height=774 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOUNCE GUN</strong> is a challenging arcade roguelike shooter with a huge number of item combinations, unconventional controls and an unusual approach to difficulty progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great news for Bullet Hell fans! We\u2019ve prepared an anthology of games in your favourite genre from various indie developers! Try out free demo versions of projects that have just recently been released or will be out in the near future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickback </strong>is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements, where shooting is the only way to move. Repel waves of mutants, create combinations of weapons and upgrades to survive at all costs on your own or with a friend in a local co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/a2c8e33edde2d271e11fc5d14e674686.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotloop </strong>- Use the force of gravity in a fast-paced space shooter with realistic physics and orbital mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/04a3e6dd0dd0257561457dd2f1373059.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Westild's Law</strong> - Journey to the heart of the Wild West in this thrilling pixelated 2D shooter and challenge the gang of Wild Joe to free your hometown from their iron grip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/d01dc47b9988bb5a585e2a9980edf365.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Break</strong> - Breakout game + physics + shooting + building. Use your mouse like in air hockey to kick enemy bombs back into the evil Black Castle! Destroy enemy towers rockets and lasers. Build your base to protect your little dudes - you need them to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=616 height=774 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/85ac5f29fb56a902292fcea6da2a49c2.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOUNCE GUN</strong> is a challenging arcade roguelike shooter with a huge number of item combinations, unconventional controls and an unusual approach to difficulty progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.poster.avif?t=1739515486\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.webm?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348300/extras/bda8e6d12ec28b67b3e89691a5f2f299.mp4?t=1739515486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
